            <span class="scramble-santa" data-final="20 MM Oz Au" data-delay="1200">20 MM Oz Au</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Oro libre en arenas y cordones (65–140 mg/m³). Cash flow inmediato y cobertura financiera total ante volatilidad de mercados.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-amber-400 text-[11px]"></i>
          <span>Récord ~$4,400 USD / oz (USD $86.6B)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: 100% Cielo Abierto & Logística -->
      <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between group transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">
            Operatividad Total
          </span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-ship text-emerald-400 text-sm"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Método de Minado & Puerto</p>
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-mono tracking-tight">
            <span class="scramble-santa" data-final="100% Tajo Abierto" data-delay="1500">100% Tajo Abierto</span>
          </div>
